WEBVTT

00:07:27.375 --> 00:07:30.518
Like -- unfortunately, like refugee camps,

00:07:30.542 --> 00:07:34.059
the slums of Mumbai,
the favelas of Latin America.

00:07:34.083 --> 00:07:37.809
Here, the temporary
is becoming the new permanent.

00:07:37.833 --> 00:07:42.143
Here, urbanism is not about grand vision,

00:07:42.167 --> 00:07:44.625
it's about grand adjustment.

00:07:45.625 --> 00:07:50.059
On the street in Mumbai,
during the Ganesh festival,

00:07:50.083 --> 00:07:51.601
a transformation.

00:07:51.625 --> 00:07:54.726
A community hall is created for 10 days.

00:07:54.750 --> 00:07:56.726
Bollywood films are shown,

00:07:56.750 --> 00:08:00.059
thousands congregate
for dinners and celebration.